# Game binaries and game data, anywhere in the tree. Nothing here is ours to
# redistribute, and the offsets work reads q2rtx.exe and q2rtx.pdb out of a
# local install, so a stray copy landing at the repo root is the realistic
# accident. A public repo cannot take one back: deleting the file later leaves
# every clone carrying it and GitHub still serving the blob by SHA.
*.exe
*.pdb
*.pak
*.pkz

# Logs
*.log

# Installer state
.headtracking-state.json
